95916070-b1046462-29a5-49b3-96cd-7294d8459477"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788046507179013893,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"013c79ba-ffc0-46d0-aa61-1727a738a133","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"e32d-6ea1-029a-435d"},{"link_uuid":"88547d1a-be44-4df6-9294-570b58fd6b0d","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"866f-440c-3686-42df"}],"description":"## Context\n\nParent epic `536b` proves the ONLY lever that shrinks the blobless CI-guarded `tickets` pack is\nreducing reachable commit+tree objects via **below-horizon history collapse**. This story builds\nthe offline rewrite ENGINE (tooling + tests + a dry-run), stopping before any prod mutation.\n\n## Scope\n\nImplement, as an offline operation over a disposable shadow clone, the collapse of below-horizon\nderived commits/trees (enrichment-quartet duplicates, superseded `TICKET_DIGEST`s, redundant\nauto-reconcile merges, and the re-emitted root/ticket trees) into SNAPSHOT-anchored checkpoints,\nusing core-git `git fast-import` (NOT third-party `git filter-repo` — not vendored; portability).\nReconcile the authorship ledger: re-resolve each `position` (`{ts}-{uuid}`, invariant across the\nrewrite) to its NEW `commit_sha` and re-anchor `identity.enforce_since` to the new baseline so\n`verify_authorship_at_commit`'s ancestry era-check evaluates consistently. Eligibility comes from\n`able-tidy-massasauga`; the horizon/boundary from the `unlikely-zealous-skua` ADR.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nPublishing/swapping the rewritten history to any remote (that is S2) and any prod mutation. This\nstory's output is validated only against a throwaway shadow clone.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The engine collapses below-horizon derived commits/trees to SNAPSHOT checkpoints on a shadow clone via core-git `git fast-import` (no third-party rewrite tool).\n- [ ] The authorship ledger is reconciled: every `position` re-resolves to its new `commit_sha` and `enforce_since` is re-anchored to the new baseline.\n- [ ] `rebar verify-authorship` is clean on the rewritten shadow branch (no unverifiable mutating event).\n- [ ] Above-horizon history and all still-observable ticket state are bit-identical in reduced form before vs after (a reducer-state equality fixture passes).\n- [ ] Unit/integration tests cover the collapse, the ledger re-resolution, and the enforce_since re-anchor.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] No prod `tickets` remote is mutated by this story (offline shadow clone only).\n\n## Portability\n\nThe rewrite primitive is core-git (`git fast-import`/`mktree`/`commit-tree`), present wherever git\nis; no dependence on any single CI provider.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/reclaim_collapse.py","reason":"New offline shadow-clone commit/tree collapse engine + ledger reconciliation + enforce_since re-anchor; CLI handler."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/core/reclaim.py","reason":"New argparse parser factory for the reclaim-collapse command."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_registry.py","reason":"Register the reclaim-collapse route (group/handler/parser)."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_reclaim_collapse.py","reason":"Unit/integration tests for the collapse, ledger position->commit_sha re-resolution, enforce_since re-anchor, and verify-authorship-clean assertions on a shadow clone."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","866f-440c-3686-42df"],["depends_on","e32d-6ea1-029a-435d"],["parent","536b-8930-b922-4063"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"536b-8930-b922-4063","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"bdf3-e7e3-c96f-4b9f","ticket_type":"story","title":"S1: below-horizon commit/tree collapse rewrite engine (offline, shadow clone)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f41a7e5c-bbc3-458a-8b10-f9b943212288","013c79ba-ffc0-46d0-aa61-1727a738a133","88547d1a-be44-4df6-9294-570b58fd6b0d","b1046462-29a5-49b3-96cd-7294d8459477"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788049924943245084,"uuid":"683a45b1-f905-4051-9eba-6a685b3eebad"}